## Break-Even Analysis

### Phase 1 Break-Even (Current)

**Monthly costs:** $283 (Q1 avg)

**Break-even requirement:** 1 client at $283/mo OR 0.19 clients at $1,500/mo

**Interpretation:** At Tier 1 pricing ($1,500/mo), **first client = profitable from Day 1**

---

### Production Scale Break-Even (5 Clients)

**Monthly costs:** $178/mo (infra $63 + AI $115)

**Revenue (5 clients @ $400 avg):** $2,000/mo

**Profit margin:** 91%

**Interpretation:** After 5 clients, every additional client is 90%+ pure margin.

---

### Malta NRP Qualification Scale (12 Clients)

**Monthly costs:** $339/mo (infra $63 + AI $276)

**Revenue (12 clients @ $350 avg):** $4,200/mo

**Profit margin:** 92%

**Malta NRP requirement:** €3,500/mo gross ($3,804/mo at $1=€0.92)

**Interpretation:** 12 clients at $350/mo = Malta qualification threshold achieved.

